Hi Michael,

Michael Bach wrote [2013-05-16 15:05]:
> Dear StatET Users and Developers,
>
> I am using StatET version 3.0.1 under Eclipse Indigo 3.7.2. When I set
> things up some time ago, R help worked nicely - presenting the
> documentation in the 'R Help' view as html.
>
